      "content": "i'm probably just overreacting honestly. my migraines get really weird sometimes and i've had similar stuff before where my limbs feel heavy. if i just take some extra ibuprofen and lay down in a dark room for a few hours, do you think that would help settle it down? i'm really trying to avoid the ER if i can just sleep it off.",
