    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but i'm just so tired of the hospital bills and the long waits. i know my body, and this just feels like the migraines i get when i'm super stressed. if i take some more ibuprofen and maybe some of my prescription migraine meds—can i take them together? it's just a lot of pain and i really just want to sleep this off and feel better in the morning without making a huge deal out of it. what do you think?",
